 * Acquiring {{M|Aghanim's Scepter}} unlocks this ability in the {{Spellslot|5|6}}.

* The ability effects are applied as follows:
*# {{Symbol|Affect|Ally}} {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
*#* All {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|earthspirit_petrify}} ability effects are applied as a debuff for both allied and enemy heroes, with the following ability effects:
*#** {{M|Attack immune}}.
*#** {{M|Stun}}
*#** {{M|Hidden}}
*#** {{M|Invisible}}
*#** {{M|Invulnerable}}
*#** Grants {{M|True Sight}} over the debuff-affected unit for the full duration.
*#* {{Symbol|Target|Unit}}
*#** Can be cast on any units, except the following units:
*#*** {{M|Creep-heroes}}.
*#*** {{M|Debuff immune}} units.
*#** {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
*#*** {{M|Doubletap}} casts the ability on Kaolin.
*#** {{Symbol|Affect|Ally}}
*#*** {{M|Disable Help}} on Kaolin prevents the allied hero from being turned into an {{A|Earth Spirit|Enchant Remnant}}.
*# {{Symbol|Stone Icon}}
*#* The debuff-affected hero is now considered a {{A|Earth Spirit|Stone Remnant}} by all of Kaolin's abilities, with its respective ability notes apply.
*# {{Symbol|Kill|Instant}}
*#* [[Instant kill]]s the following units after the Enchant Remnant duration:
*#** {{M|Attached-type units}}.
*#** {{M|Ward-type units}}.

