 {{Stonecraft}}

* The ability effects are applied as follows:
*# {{Symbol|Affect|Self}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Projectile|Base}}
*#* Turns Kaolin into a [[projectile]] and applies the following ability effects on Kaolin throughout the ability cast, until Rolling Boulder ends:
*#** {{M|Disarm}}
*#** {{M|Rooted}}
*#** {{M|Phase movement}}.
*#** {{M|Unobstructed movement}}, can move Kaolin over {{M|impassable terrain}}.
*#* This ability component can only be interrupted by the following sources: 
*#** {{M|Cyclone}} sources.
*#** {{M|Fear}} sources.
*#** {{M|Hex}} sources.
*#** {{M|Hidden}} sources, including {{Symbol|bonus agh}} {{A|Earth Spirit|Enchant Remnant}}.
*#** {{M|Sleep}} sources.
*#** {{M|Stun}} sources.
*#* When interrupted, subsequent ability effects does not apply, the ability then goes into {{M|cooldown}} and consumes {{M|mana}}.
*# {{Symbol|Affect|Self}} {{Symbol|Projectile|Roll}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Target|Point}}
*#* {{#var:Rolling Boulder value1}} seconds after casting, Kaolin rolls the max distance, according to the {{Symbol|Target|Point}} point-targeted direction, if the ability does not collide with an enemy hero.
*#* {{Symbol|Projectile|Travel}}
*#** Rolls forward at {{#var:Rolling Boulder basic1}}-speed, reaching max distance in {{Symbol|bonus cas}} {{#expr:{{#var:Rolling Boulder value4}}/{{#var:Rolling Boulder basic1}}}} ({{Symbol|bonus t1l}} {{ValueColor||{{#expr:{{#var:Rolling Boulder value4 tal}}/{{#var:Rolling Boulder basic1}}}}|10tal}}) seconds by default.
*#** Applies the following effects while rolling:
*#*** {{M|Invulnerable}}
*#*** {{M|Untargetable}}
*#* Other {{Symbol|Target|No}} non-targeted abilities as per normal, with {{Symbol|Target|Unit}} {{Symbol|Target|AreaAlt}} {{Symbol|Target|Point}} {{Symbol|Target|Ground}} targeted abilities still require Kaolin to {{M|Turn Rate|text=turn}} to cast.
*# {{Symbol|Projectile|Roll}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Stone Icon}}
*#* {{Symbol|Kill|Instant}}
*#** Only the first collided Remnant-unit [[Instant kill|shatters]] immediately upon collision, and other Remnant-units along the way are ignored.
*#** {{cf|aghnotes}} Immediately {{M|dispels}} the {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{A|Earth Spirit|Enchant Remnant}} upon rolling through the Remnant-unit, and applies the {{M|spell damage}} component, if applicable.
*#* The following ability effects are updated immediately upon colliding with a Remnant-unit:
*#** {{Symbol|Projectile|Travel}} {{Symbol|a|Up}}
*#*** Rolls forward at {{#expr:{{#vardefineecho:Rolling Stone speed|({{#var:Rolling Boulder basic1}}+{{#var:Rolling Boulder type2 value2}})}}}}-speed, reaching max distance in {{Symbol|bonus cas}} {{#expr:{{#var:Rolling Boulder value4}}*{{#var:Rolling Boulder type2 value1}}/{{#var:Rolling Stone speed}} round2}} ({{Symbol|bonus t1l}} {{ValueColor||{{#expr:{{#var:Rolling Boulder value4 tal}}*{{#var:Rolling Boulder type2 value1}}/{{#var:Rolling Stone speed}} round2}}|10tal}}) seconds, and is defined as:
*#**** {{cf|expr}} {{Code|Σ RollDuration {{=}} Distance × {{#var:Rolling Boulder type2 value1}} / (ProjectileSpeed + StoneSpeedBonus)}}
*#** {{Symbol|Stun}} {{Symbol|a|Up}}
*#*** Increases the [[stun]] duration according to the stone stun duration bonus.
*#**** {{cf|expr}} {{Code|Σ StunDuration {{=}} ({{#var:Rolling Boulder type1 value4}} + {{ValueColor||{{Show|T|Earth Spirit|v2r}}|tal|x}}) + {{#var:Rolling Boulder type2 value3}}}}
*# {{Symbol|Trees}}
*#* [[Trees]] within ≈100-radius of Kaolin are destroyed upon contact.
*# {{Symbol|Projectile|Roll}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Projectile|Impact}} {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
*#* Upon colliding with an enemy hero, Kaolin stops rolling, and {{M|teleports}} {{#var:Rolling Boulder type1 value1}}-distance across the [[Wikipedia:Extended side|extended side]] of the collided direction.
*#** Considers {{M|clones}} as heroes; {{M|illusions}} and {{M|creep-heroes}} as creeps.
*#* Does not collide with the following units:
*#** {{M|Couriers}}
*#** {{M|Hidden}} units.
*#** {{M|Invulnerable}} units.
*#** {{M|Ward-type units}}.
*#* Collides with the following enemy heroes:
*#** {{M|Invisible}} units.
*# {{Symbol|Affect|Self}} {{Symbol|bonus cd}}
*#* The ability [[cooldown]] starts at this point, once Rolling Boulder ends, not upon cast.
*#* {{Symbol|Turn Rate}}
*#** Kaolin now {{M|facing angle|text=faces}} the enemy unit.
*#* {{Symbol|Taunt}}
*#** With [[taunt]] sources, Kaolin now attempts or starts attacking the taunting unit.
*# {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
*#* Checks Kaolin's {{M|strength}}, then applies the {{M|magical}} {{M|spell damage}} value, and is defined as:
*#** {{cf|expr}} {{Code|[[Spell Damage|SplDmg]] {{=}} {{#var:Rolling Boulder type1 value2}} + Σ[[Strength|Str]] × ({{#var:Rolling Boulder type1 value3}} + {{ValueColor||{{Show|T|Earth Spirit|v3l}}|tal|x}})}}
*# {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
*#* Applies the {{Symbol|Stun}} {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|[[stun]]ned}} duration corresponding to the aformentioned values.

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Rolling Boulder icon0}}
| desc = Earth Spirit gathers himself into a boulder and, after a 0.6s delay, rolls toward the target location, dealing 60 + 100% STR damage and stunning enemy units. He will stop if he collides with an enemy hero or is stunned. If he rolls over a Stone Remnant, he will travel further and faster, and stun enemies for longer.
}}

